# Line-ending policy.
#
# Development happens on Windows; CI runs on ubuntu-latest and verifies
# artifacts with sha256sum. Any CRLF drift silently breaks those hash checks,
# so every text file is normalized to LF in the working tree and in Git.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts must never be normalized.
*.zip  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
